DraftPredict
============

The statistical draft-analysis engine in `packages/core` is a TypeScript port of
DraftGap's core package.

    DraftGap — https://github.com/vigovlugt/draftgap
    Copyright (c) 2026 Vigo Vlugt
    Licensed under the MIT License (see tests/reference/DRAFTGAP-LICENSE)

`tests/reference/draftgap-core` contains an unmodified copy of DraftGap's core
sources. It is used exclusively by the parity test-suite to prove that the
ported engine reproduces DraftGap's results, and is not shipped in any build.

League of Legends static data in `packages/data/assets/ddragon` comes from Riot
Games' Data Dragon. DraftPredict isn't endorsed by Riot Games and doesn't
reflect the views or opinions of Riot Games or anyone officially involved in
producing or managing Riot Games properties.
